==Restrictions==
*Rarity: Only [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal]], [[:Category:Special Cats|Special]] and [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare]]
*4-Crown: Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*1 [[Nono (Enemy)|Nono]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Nono (Enemy)|Nono]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Orthos (Enemy)|Orthos]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Nono (Enemy)|Nonos]] spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==

* This stage, alongside [[On Holy Wings]] and [[Blade Ritual]], are the only stages in the game where the restrictions under 4-star is not a "Special/Rares only" restriction, but rather a "10 Cats Only" restriction alongside the original restrictions.

